RayMothFM

RayMothFM is the upstream file manager project by Halano (@HalanoSiblee).
It is distributed under the MIT License; see the repository LICENSE file.

The Debian lightweight build statically links Raylib 5.5. Raylib is by Ramon
Santamaria (@raysan5) and is distributed under its zlib-style license. The
Raylib build used here includes GLFW, which carries its own zlib-style license.

The corresponding license notices are installed under:
  /usr/share/doc/raymothfm/copyright
  /usr/share/doc/raymothfm/RAYLIB-5.5.txt
  /usr/share/doc/raymothfm/GLFW.txt

The Gamma Linux Debian build integration is maintained in this fork. It does
not change the ownership or authorship of the upstream RayMothFM application.
